(Jung Yong Hwa)

2
00:00:15,968 --> 00:00:18,908
(Hong Seung Hee)

3
00:00:18,978 --> 00:00:22,178
(Lee Yi Kyung)

4
00:00:23,248 --> 00:00:25,278
(Park Yu Na)

5
00:00:36,498 --> 00:00:39,898
(Oh! My Guard)

6
00:00:39,968 --> 00:00:41,398
(This drama is a work of fiction.)

7
00:00:41,468 --> 00:00:42,938
(Also, children and animals were filmed under production guidelines.)

8
00:00:44,238 --> 00:00:46,268
Hey, kid. Want to play?

9
00:01:12,098 --> 00:01:13,098
Hey.

10
00:01:15,498 --> 00:01:17,038
Hey.

11
00:01:17,098 --> 00:01:18,368
Wake up. Hey.

12
00:01:20,308 --> 00:01:22,668
(Episode 3)

13
00:01:24,308 --> 00:01:26,308
I fell asleep at the worst time.

14
00:01:26,378 --> 00:01:27,678
I will head in first.

15
00:01:27,748 --> 00:01:29,848
- Okay.
- I will get going.

16
00:01:43,858 --> 00:01:45,428
I think...

17
00:01:45,498 --> 00:01:49,328
she might have caught wind of your fatal flaw.

18
00:01:49,398 --> 00:01:53,538
Well, this happened because you are just too good at it.

19
00:01:53,608 --> 00:01:55,208
I mean, whenever you kiss them, the actresses...

20
00:01:55,268 --> 00:01:57,508
get weak in the knees, so how can they act?

21
00:01:57,578 --> 00:01:59,608
This is not about you, but the actresses, right?

22
00:01:59,678 --> 00:02:01,478
That is fatal.

23
00:02:01,548 --> 00:02:03,118
Okay, I will keep it a secret.

24
00:02:12,258 --> 00:02:16,228
That Female Reporter really underestimated Tae Bong and me.

25
00:02:16,298 --> 00:02:19,328
If I mention "fatal flaw" first,

26
00:02:19,398 --> 00:02:21,128
that is the signal that someone set a trap.

27
00:02:21,198 --> 00:02:22,968
But we should use that to our advantage.

28
00:02:30,778 --> 00:02:32,078
What do I do?

29
00:02:38,348 --> 00:02:39,348
Oh, that startled me.

30
00:02:45,058 --> 00:02:46,558
- Hey, Tae Bong?
- Hello?

31
00:02:46,628 --> 00:02:48,258
The owner of this phone passed out...

32
00:02:48,328 --> 00:02:51,798
Wait, wait. You absolutely cannot call 911.

33
00:02:51,858 --> 00:02:53,198
Just stay right there.

34
00:02:53,268 --> 00:02:55,968
If there is any newspaper around,

35
00:02:56,028 --> 00:02:57,338
could you cover his face with it?

36
00:02:57,398 --> 00:02:59,608
No, no. Never mind. Just stay right where you are.

37
00:02:59,668 --> 00:03:01,168
Stay right there, just like that.

38
00:03:04,838 --> 00:03:07,178
Hey, Su Dong. You set up the tracker on Tae Bong's phone, right?

39
00:03:07,248 --> 00:03:08,248
Taxi!

40
00:03:40,808 --> 00:03:44,148
Stop, stop. Wait, hold on a second.

41
00:03:44,218 --> 00:03:45,218
Tae Bong!

42
00:03:59,398 --> 00:04:00,798
I knew this would happen one day.

43
00:04:02,028 --> 00:04:06,268
What am I going to do with you? Oh, man.

44
00:04:06,338 --> 00:04:08,808
Are you Sleeping Beauty or something?

45
00:04:09,808 --> 00:04:12,578
Does that make me one of the seven dwarfs? What is this?

46
00:04:13,648 --> 00:04:14,648
Darn it.

47
00:04:32,898 --> 00:04:35,468
We definitely made eye contact.

48
00:04:35,528 --> 00:04:39,838
The fact that he passed out even more after I gave him CPR means...

49
00:04:39,908 --> 00:04:42,038
Did he really faint because our lips touched?

50
00:04:43,378 --> 00:04:46,748
What is it? Did I pass on some kind of bacteria?

51
00:04:50,248 --> 00:04:51,818
If not that...

52
00:04:53,388 --> 00:04:55,248
While he lived his life completely forgetting about me,

53
00:04:55,318 --> 00:04:57,218
what really happened to him...

54
00:04:59,558 --> 00:05:01,288
What?

55
00:05:01,358 --> 00:05:02,528
I did not give him the ring.

56
00:05:13,138 --> 00:05:14,508
What? Am I home?

57
00:05:16,138 --> 00:05:18,338
(CEO Park)

58
00:05:24,978 --> 00:05:26,018
Why are you calling so early?

59
00:05:26,078 --> 00:05:29,718
My body aches from carrying you and putting you to bed, you punk.

60
00:05:29,788 --> 00:05:30,788
Did you bring me here?

61
00:05:30,858 --> 00:05:33,428
Well, who else would it be if not me? Hey.

62
00:05:35,188 --> 00:05:36,928
Anyway,

63
00:05:36,998 --> 00:05:38,398
who was that young woman last night?

64
00:05:43,168 --> 00:05:45,268
If you passed out while you two were together,

65
00:05:45,338 --> 00:05:46,538
did you two...

66
00:05:47,968 --> 00:05:49,238
do it?

67
00:05:49,308 --> 00:05:50,508
Do what?

68
00:05:51,808 --> 00:05:53,648
Why, did that woman...

69
00:05:54,948 --> 00:05:56,648
say something?

70
00:05:56,718 --> 00:05:59,348
I just assumed you had a concussion and left.

71
00:05:59,418 --> 00:06:01,118
Who is she, really?

72
00:06:01,188 --> 00:06:03,988
I do not know. She is a woman I will never see again.

73
00:06:04,058 --> 00:06:05,058
Are you sure?

74
00:06:06,318 --> 00:06:07,828
Hey, by the way,

75
00:06:07,888 --> 00:06:10,658
- this isn't you, is it?
- Did you see this article?

76
00:06:10,728 --> 00:06:11,958
Yes, I am looking at it right now.

77
00:06:13,298 --> 00:06:15,028
Who is this bag man?

78
00:06:15,098 --> 00:06:16,128
Is this woman his girlfriend?

79
00:06:16,198 --> 00:06:17,768
Hey, she is definitely his girlfriend.

80
00:06:17,838 --> 00:06:18,838
What is it?

81
00:06:20,938 --> 00:06:21,938
What are you looking at?

82
00:06:22,008 --> 00:06:23,838
Hey, look at this. Is it not hilarious?

83
00:06:23,908 --> 00:06:25,008
Is he not a weirdo?

84
00:06:25,078 --> 00:06:27,108
- Look at him wearing a bag.
- This is insane.

85
00:06:28,708 --> 00:06:29,718
Darn it.

86
00:06:32,948 --> 00:06:33,988
Hey, where are you going?

87
00:06:39,858 --> 00:06:42,528
It is Tae Bong no matter how you look at it.

88
00:06:42,588 --> 00:06:43,658
What should I do about this...

89
00:06:44,658 --> 00:06:47,768
What was the point of me acting my heart out to lose her last night,

90
00:06:47,828 --> 00:06:49,628
when this jerk is running around causing trouble like this?

91
00:06:54,138 --> 00:06:57,208
Wait a minute. This woman from last night...

92
00:06:57,278 --> 00:06:59,508
There is a woman I like.

93
00:06:59,578 --> 00:07:00,578
What?

94
00:07:02,708 --> 00:07:04,578
No, it cannot be.

95
00:07:04,648 --> 00:07:06,048
He said she is someone he will never see again.

96
00:07:07,318 --> 00:07:10,218
Man, how deep does this go?

97
00:07:18,398 --> 00:07:20,768
(Sports Daehan)

98
00:07:21,768 --> 00:07:24,198
What brings you to call this early in the morning?

99
00:07:24,268 --> 00:07:27,908
I called because I was worried about how your stomach is doing.

100
00:07:27,968 --> 00:07:30,038
It was burning a bit last night,

101
00:07:30,108 --> 00:07:32,678
but I received an amazing photo overnight,

102
00:07:32,738 --> 00:07:35,308
so now I feel completely relieved.

103
00:07:35,378 --> 00:07:36,448
I see.

104
00:07:37,748 --> 00:07:40,848
You must have been constipated, right?

105
00:07:43,158 --> 00:07:48,458
Anyway, the reason I called is, I saw the article you wrote,

106
00:07:48,528 --> 00:07:51,758
and I am very curious about the actor in it.

107
00:07:51,828 --> 00:07:53,368
I never wrote that it was an actor.

108
00:07:56,128 --> 00:07:58,938
- You did not.
- Do not worry.

109
00:07:58,998 --> 00:08:01,768
I got a tip that it was Um Star, but I have professional ethics.

110
00:08:01,838 --> 00:08:03,778
I cannot reveal his real name without a picture of his face.

111
00:08:03,838 --> 00:08:05,808
So you do not have a picture of his face?

112
00:08:05,878 --> 00:08:08,078
But whose face is that in the picture with him?

113
00:08:08,148 --> 00:08:10,478
Is she Um Star's real hidden lover?

114
00:08:10,548 --> 00:08:12,748
Oh, what are you talking about? He has Song Na Ri.

115
00:08:12,818 --> 00:08:14,318
CEO Park, are you inside?

116
00:08:14,388 --> 00:08:16,448
I have another call coming in. Sorry.

117
00:08:17,488 --> 00:08:19,218
- What, why, why?
- CEO Park?

118
00:08:21,258 --> 00:08:24,198
Did you see the article? Who is that girl in front of Tae Bong?

119
00:08:24,258 --> 00:08:26,128
What are you talking about? What do you mean, Tae Bong?

120
00:08:26,198 --> 00:08:27,668
Na Ri, our pretty Na Ri.

121
00:08:27,728 --> 00:08:29,838
Why are you coming here and throwing a fit too?

122
00:08:29,898 --> 00:08:31,368
That outfit Tae Bong is wearing,

123
00:08:31,438 --> 00:08:33,538
