124
00:08:33,608 --> 00:08:35,708
I am going to destroy Um Tae Bong.

125
00:08:36,778 --> 00:08:38,978
I am sorry. I am so embarrassed. Come out quickly.

126
00:08:39,038 --> 00:08:40,178
Just wait and see.

127
00:08:40,248 --> 00:08:42,178
You will see if I can seduce him or not.

128
00:08:49,418 --> 00:08:51,688
