129
00:08:52,888 --> 00:08:55,528
What sin did I commit in my past life?

130
00:09:06,198 --> 00:09:07,938
She really does not know,

131
00:09:09,338 --> 00:09:10,378
right?

132
00:09:13,278 --> 00:09:16,478
Wow, this one and this one too. They look really warm.

133
00:09:16,548 --> 00:09:19,918
Wow, where did you get all of these?

134
00:09:19,988 --> 00:09:22,618
I am the head of our neighbourhood.

135
00:09:22,688 --> 00:09:25,858
I went around and told people to make some donations.

136
00:09:25,918 --> 00:09:28,188
I will definitely repay this favour too.

137
00:09:29,588 --> 00:09:33,028
But why is this one not working? Are the batteries dead?

138
00:09:36,998 --> 00:09:39,338
- It has some.
- What? How do you know that?

139
00:09:39,398 --> 00:09:42,208
If there is battery left, the tip of your tongue...

140
00:09:45,578 --> 00:09:46,878
tingles.

141
00:09:49,008 --> 00:09:50,518
Do you want to try?

142
00:09:50,578 --> 00:09:51,578
Yes.

143
00:10:02,088 --> 00:10:04,798
Yes, I guess that is what a first kiss is like.

144
00:10:08,968 --> 00:10:13,068
It tingles just like electricity.

145
00:10:17,208 --> 00:10:22,378
Oh my, she sucked on the battery and lost her mind.

146
00:10:22,448 --> 00:10:27,088
Did you have your first kiss last night or something?

147
00:10:27,148 --> 00:10:30,918
What? What first kiss?

148
00:10:49,438 --> 00:10:52,138
Look at you getting all nervous.

149
00:10:52,208 --> 00:10:55,348
I told you I would teach you how to kiss.

150
00:11:04,218 --> 00:11:06,858
I am a total pro,

151
00:11:06,928 --> 00:11:08,558
so why did I act like that yesterday?

152
00:11:09,688 --> 00:11:13,058
I had never felt that way before.

153
00:11:15,498 --> 00:11:17,768
Oh, right. That actor, Um Tae Bong.

154
00:11:17,838 --> 00:11:19,598
Why does he really refuse to film kiss scenes?

155
00:11:19,668 --> 00:11:23,238
How should I know? But there is something.

156
00:11:23,308 --> 00:11:25,138
A deep backstory.

157
00:11:25,208 --> 00:11:26,878
There really is something going on.

158
00:11:28,178 --> 00:11:29,548
Is that why he looked a bit lonely?

159
00:11:34,018 --> 00:11:37,588
Stop sucking on that. Now get up, get up, okay?

160
00:11:37,658 --> 00:11:38,688
And take this.

161
00:11:43,558 --> 00:11:47,268
It will soon be the 29.

162
00:11:47,328 --> 00:11:48,568
Why? What day is that?

163
00:11:49,728 --> 00:11:51,298
The day I meet my dad.

164
00:11:56,438 --> 00:11:57,878
Excuse me.

165
00:11:57,938 --> 00:12:00,608
Do you happen to know where this customer went?

166
00:12:00,678 --> 00:12:03,278
No idea. We just check them out and that is it.

167
00:12:06,618 --> 00:12:10,158
So, are the promotions for the new car coming along well?

168
00:12:10,218 --> 00:12:13,088
Yes. For the TV commercials, we plan to highlight the brand's value...

169
00:12:13,158 --> 00:12:16,058
and stimulate the desire to purchase through emotional storytelling.

170
00:12:16,128 --> 00:12:17,828
Good.

171
00:12:17,898 --> 00:12:19,128
What does everyone else think?

172
00:12:19,198 --> 00:12:20,628
- Sounds good.
- I like it.

173
00:12:20,698 --> 00:12:21,698
Okay.

174
00:12:22,768 --> 00:12:27,138
Anyway, the shareholders' meeting is soon, so how is Chairman Wang?

175
00:12:31,378 --> 00:12:33,708
It is nothing for you all to worry about.

176
00:12:33,778 --> 00:12:35,678
Why would we be worried?

177
00:12:35,748 --> 00:12:38,648
We just thought you would have a lot on your mind, Chairman Oh.

178
00:12:38,718 --> 00:12:42,388
Does this look like the place for such personal concerns?

179
00:12:50,598 --> 00:12:51,598
It is a call from Manager Nam Goong.

180
00:12:51,658 --> 00:12:53,998
- Later.
- He says it is urgent.

181
00:12:56,968 --> 00:12:57,998
Let us wrap up for today.

182
00:13:08,478 --> 00:13:10,818
What is going on that he is telling us to leave?

183
00:13:12,278 --> 00:13:14,618
If it were not for his late wife,

184
00:13:14,688 --> 00:13:17,788
