185
00:13:17,858 --> 00:13:20,188
You know how Chairman Wang is.

186
00:13:20,258 --> 00:13:21,728
You know, right?

187
00:13:21,788 --> 00:13:24,158
The real owner of this company. The man sitting over there...

188
00:13:24,228 --> 00:13:27,128
