189
00:13:27,198 --> 00:13:28,198
Yes.

190
00:13:29,668 --> 00:13:32,198
Chairman Wang is incredible.

191
00:13:32,268 --> 00:13:33,608
He is absolutely determined...

192
00:13:33,668 --> 00:13:35,138
not to give the company to his son-in-law.

193
00:13:35,208 --> 00:13:36,938
He just put him in that position,

194
00:13:37,008 --> 00:13:38,208
but he made sure his daughter's shares...

195
00:13:38,278 --> 00:13:39,978
