197
00:13:41,648 --> 00:13:45,478
Does that not say it all? But that heiress...

198
00:13:45,548 --> 00:13:48,788
- is too shrouded in mystery.
- It makes sense.

199
00:13:50,018 --> 00:13:51,888
A young child went through something like that.

200
00:13:55,858 --> 00:13:57,328
The young lady's whereabouts are still...

201
