203
00:14:07,908 --> 00:14:09,638
Do you think he does not have ears here?

204
00:14:09,708 --> 00:14:10,738
I think something might have happened...

205
00:14:10,808 --> 00:14:12,508
to the young lady.

206
00:14:13,778 --> 00:14:18,078
- Did you find her?
- We found the young lady on CCTV.

207
00:14:18,148 --> 00:14:20,218
But she looks different from usual...

208
00:14:20,288 --> 00:14:22,548
Is it anything new for her to be strange?

209
00:14:22,618 --> 00:14:23,958
Get rid of the CCTV footage...

210
00:14:24,018 --> 00:14:25,288
