211
00:14:38,198 --> 00:14:40,208
(Taekwondo)

212
00:15:04,958 --> 00:15:06,398
Darn it.

213
00:15:09,398 --> 00:15:10,668
Let's have a match.

214
00:15:13,498 --> 00:15:15,168
Are you sure you have a certificate?

215
00:15:15,238 --> 00:15:16,638
Someone who can't even do a basic kick,

216
00:15:16,708 --> 00:15:18,238
how can I hire you?

217
00:15:18,308 --> 00:15:20,708
Has my body gotten too stiff?

218
00:15:20,778 --> 00:15:22,278
What is seriously wrong with me?

219
00:15:45,168 --> 00:15:46,238
Are we done here?

220
00:15:53,978 --> 00:15:57,078
Hey, I have a question for you.

221
00:15:58,578 --> 00:15:59,778
About last night.

222
00:16:00,918 --> 00:16:03,288
I mean, you and me...

223
00:16:04,918 --> 00:16:05,918
By any chance...

224
00:16:10,528 --> 00:16:11,628
Are you listening to me?

225
00:16:12,898 --> 00:16:15,328
- It was electrifying.
- Hey.

226
00:16:15,398 --> 00:16:17,968
You startled me. Why are you yelling?

227
00:16:18,038 --> 00:16:19,298
You used to just boss people around,

228
00:16:19,368 --> 00:16:20,868
but did becoming an actor make you even grumpier?

229
00:16:20,938 --> 00:16:23,338
For someone who became so successful,

230
00:16:23,408 --> 00:16:25,438
