544
00:35:18,938 --> 00:35:21,978
- I am 28 years old.
- Wow, you look young for your age.

545
00:35:22,048 --> 00:35:23,508
I thought you were 27.

546
00:35:27,648 --> 00:35:31,858
Unbelievable. Smiling at just anyone.

547
00:35:31,918 --> 00:35:34,618
She only frowns at me, seriously.

548
00:35:34,688 --> 00:35:37,458
- Who? Who only frowns at you?
- Oh, you startled me.

549
00:35:37,528 --> 00:35:40,958
Oh, Director. Your jokes are the best in the industry, too.

550
00:35:41,028 --> 00:35:42,868
But who is that?

551
00:35:42,928 --> 00:35:45,538
- I have never seen her before.
- The new stylist.

552
00:35:47,038 --> 00:35:49,968
But she looks like a total country bumpkin.

553
00:35:50,038 --> 00:35:52,278
Is she really a stylist?

554
00:35:52,338 --> 00:35:53,608
Hurry up and get ready.

555
00:35:55,878 --> 00:35:58,008
She was at the park with you...

556
00:35:59,148 --> 00:36:02,088
What the? Where did he go?

557
00:36:02,148 --> 00:36:03,548
Darn it.

558
00:36:11,158 --> 00:36:12,158
Hey, Su Dong.

559
00:36:15,998 --> 00:36:18,068
What? Do you need to poop?

560
00:36:19,198 --> 00:36:21,368
Where did you buy that sandwich earlier?

561
00:36:21,438 --> 00:36:23,768
I should report them to the FDA. I really should.

562
00:36:23,838 --> 00:36:25,038
Are you really holding in your poop?

563
00:36:25,108 --> 00:36:26,708
Stop talking to me.

564
00:36:29,378 --> 00:36:31,618
The restroom is right there.

565
00:36:31,678 --> 00:36:33,578
