- Why did you come in here?
- Are you okay? Is everything fine?

574
00:37:33,038 --> 00:37:34,378
What about the man who just came in?

575
00:37:35,878 --> 00:37:37,578
What man?

576
00:37:37,648 --> 00:37:39,918
I definitely saw him. A suspicious man.

577
00:37:43,418 --> 00:37:45,958
Great job.

578
00:37:46,018 --> 00:37:48,358
- Get out right now.
- I really saw him.

579
00:37:48,428 --> 00:37:49,528
Get out, hurry.

580
00:37:52,658 --> 00:37:54,458
Come in. Hurry.

581
00:38:07,678 --> 00:38:11,178
