582
00:38:12,318 --> 00:38:14,178
We both look like total perverts, right?

583
00:38:15,418 --> 00:38:17,648
The cover-up operation.

584
00:38:17,718 --> 00:38:18,818
You...

585
00:38:18,888 --> 00:38:20,558
protect me.

586
00:38:20,618 --> 00:38:21,728
Because I...

587
00:38:23,428 --> 00:38:24,758
will protect myself, too.

588
00:38:46,578 --> 00:38:49,288
I am sorry. Oh, come on.

589
00:38:50,318 --> 00:38:51,888
Is he crazy or what?

590
00:38:56,488 --> 00:38:59,458
Crazy lunatics. Just wait until I catch you.

591
00:39:00,658 --> 00:39:02,728
But that outfit looks really familiar.

592
00:39:03,728 --> 00:39:05,298
Is it the same one you wore earlier?

593
00:39:07,738 --> 00:39:09,408
