594
00:39:09,468 --> 00:39:11,678
I have never seen such a different design in my life.

595
00:39:14,238 --> 00:39:15,878
Just throw it away and forget about it.

596
00:39:17,748 --> 00:39:19,378
This is all your fault.

597
00:39:19,448 --> 00:39:21,148
Why did you come into the men's room?

598
00:39:22,518 --> 00:39:25,418
I only went in because I was worried about you.

599
00:39:25,488 --> 00:39:27,288
You petty jerk.

600
00:39:27,358 --> 00:39:28,358
Petty?

601
00:39:30,488 --> 00:39:32,798
Why you little.

602
00:39:32,858 --> 00:39:36,068
- Our contract is cancelled.
- What?

603
00:39:36,128 --> 00:39:37,528
Then what about my promised salary?

604
00:39:37,598 --> 00:39:40,098
- What about my rent from now on?
- Why should I care?

605
00:39:41,568 --> 00:39:43,608
If you fire me,

606
00:39:43,668 --> 00:39:46,108
