607
00:39:50,548 --> 00:39:51,548
What secrets?

608
00:39:54,718 --> 00:39:56,688
Everyone, you know Um Tae Bong, right?

609
00:39:56,748 --> 00:39:58,218
Actually, earlier today, Um Tae Bong...

610
00:39:58,288 --> 00:40:00,388
took a massive dump.

611
00:40:02,928 --> 00:40:03,928
Darn it.

612
00:40:08,768 --> 00:40:11,468
When did I ever take a massive dump...

613
00:40:13,568 --> 00:40:17,238
Exposing someone's secret? With no manners?

614
00:40:17,308 --> 00:40:20,908
You have zero public decency. Right, guys?

615
00:40:23,508 --> 00:40:26,478
If you threaten me with my secrets one more time, then...

616
00:40:26,548 --> 00:40:27,548
Please let me out.

617
00:40:35,658 --> 00:40:37,558
Getting carsick is so uncool.

618
00:40:47,638 --> 00:40:49,568
Why am I always like this in cars?

619
00:40:52,208 --> 00:40:54,838
But it is really cheap of him to threaten to cancel the contract.

620
00:40:56,508 --> 00:40:57,508
Hong Du?

621
00:40:58,818 --> 00:40:59,818
What?

622
00:41:01,918 --> 00:41:02,918
Hello.

623
00:41:05,388 --> 00:41:06,658
Drink this.

624
00:41:06,718 --> 00:41:09,158
Chamomile is good for settling your stomach.

625
00:41:09,228 --> 00:41:11,128
Thank you.

626
00:41:11,188 --> 00:41:13,498
But it is uncomfortable if you keep being so formal.

627
00:41:13,558 --> 00:41:15,598
You are much older than me.

628
00:41:15,668 --> 00:41:17,968
Shall I, then?

629
00:41:18,028 --> 00:41:21,568
I was really surprised earlier. How did you know my name?

630
00:41:21,638 --> 00:41:24,908
Oh, when you came to our shop that day.

631
00:41:26,208 --> 00:41:30,108
By the way, did you already know Tae Bong?

632
00:41:30,178 --> 00:41:33,278
Oh, with Han Jung Woo...

633
00:41:33,348 --> 00:41:35,148
No, with Um Tae Bong...

634
00:41:35,218 --> 00:41:37,048
No, no, Han Jung Woo...

635
00:41:37,118 --> 00:41:38,718
Anyway, with that jerk...

636
00:41:38,788 --> 00:41:42,228
Keep this in mind. The contract with me is an absolute secret.

637
00:41:44,188 --> 00:41:45,958
We are nothing to each other.

638
00:41:46,028 --> 00:41:47,498
Oh, really?

639
00:41:48,628 --> 00:41:50,768
You two looked close last time I saw you.

640
00:41:50,828 --> 00:41:52,268
Oh, that is...

641
00:41:54,268 --> 00:41:57,668
Actually, I am his body...

642
00:41:57,738 --> 00:42:00,638
Do not forget. If you break it, you pay ten times the penalty.

643
00:42:01,738 --> 00:42:04,208
I'm not just an average fan...

644
00:42:04,278 --> 00:42:05,878
I am a huge fan.

645
00:42:10,048 --> 00:42:12,188
(The Crown Prince's Bodyguard Information)

646
00:42:14,018 --> 00:42:16,558
Oh, right, what about your family?

647
00:42:16,628 --> 00:42:20,758
Up until middle school, it was just me and my father,

648
00:42:20,828 --> 00:42:23,328
