650
00:42:25,368 --> 00:42:27,998
- What?
- Oh, my.

651
00:42:28,068 --> 00:42:30,408
Was it always 4 kimchi stews and 1 soft tofu stew?

652
00:42:30,468 --> 00:42:32,138
I guess I just got used to saying things like that.

653
00:42:33,408 --> 00:42:36,478
Actually, I was the queen of part-time jobs.

654
00:42:36,548 --> 00:42:39,548
Your father must be very proud.

655
00:42:39,618 --> 00:42:41,478
If he were here, he would have scolded me a lot...

656
00:42:41,548 --> 00:42:43,918
for working to earn money instead of studying.

657
00:42:43,988 --> 00:42:47,288
Oh, I am sorry.

658
00:42:47,358 --> 00:42:48,858
Oh, it is fine.

659
00:42:48,928 --> 00:42:51,728
He is coming to visit tomorrow anyway.

660
00:42:51,788 --> 00:42:53,228
It is the anniversary of his death.

661
00:42:54,228 --> 00:42:58,168
(Her father's sudden death made Cha Hong Du Part-Time Queen...)

662
00:42:59,838 --> 00:43:01,098
That is all from the drama.

663
00:43:03,068 --> 00:43:05,008
She said she is a fan of Um Tae Bong,

664
00:43:05,068 --> 00:43:07,438
so is she imitating the tragic heroine?

665
00:43:08,848 --> 00:43:13,018
Oh, Song Na Ri, have you finally become a decent human being?

666
00:43:13,078 --> 00:43:15,288
Coming out to support the writer on your day off.

667
00:43:15,348 --> 00:43:16,648
But why are you really here?

668
00:43:16,718 --> 00:43:18,218
You probably did not just come to bring me coffee.

669
00:43:19,518 --> 00:43:22,888
Is the ending for this one sad too?

670
00:43:22,958 --> 00:43:25,058
Does someone die this time too?

671
00:43:25,128 --> 00:43:26,128
Well...

672
00:43:27,158 --> 00:43:28,398
Why?

673
00:43:28,458 --> 00:43:30,028
Do you want the two of them to have a happy ending?

674
00:43:31,968 --> 00:43:33,938
No, it is just that if it happens in the drama,

675
00:43:33,998 --> 00:43:36,238
I feel like it will happen in real life too.

676
00:43:37,338 --> 00:43:39,038
Writer Pyo,

677
00:43:39,108 --> 00:43:42,178
I really like Tae Bong.

678
00:43:44,648 --> 00:43:47,178
Oh, go ahead, who is stopping you?

679
00:43:48,618 --> 00:43:49,648
So...

680
00:43:52,358 --> 00:43:56,128
It hurts right here, like my heart is completely tattered.

681
00:43:56,188 --> 00:43:59,558
Oh my, you are way too immersed in this.

682
00:43:59,628 --> 00:44:01,098
Just like in the drama,

683
00:44:03,028 --> 00:44:04,798
I want to be in love in real life too.

684
00:44:07,598 --> 00:44:10,238
I should not say this as a writer, but...

685
00:44:10,308 --> 00:44:12,678
