695
00:45:00,358 --> 00:45:01,388
Hold it right there.

696
00:45:03,358 --> 00:45:05,928
If you put your butt on my Ddabong,

697
00:45:05,998 --> 00:45:08,658
I will kick your butt.

698
00:45:10,428 --> 00:45:12,098
Ddabong? What is Ddabong?

699
00:45:12,168 --> 00:45:13,898
It is Tae Bong's younger sibling, so it is Ddabong.

700
00:45:13,968 --> 00:45:17,838
