712
00:45:56,448 --> 00:45:58,708
Oh, I just called. Why?

713
00:45:58,778 --> 00:46:00,248
Oh, man.

714
00:46:00,318 --> 00:46:02,148
Hello...

715
00:46:02,218 --> 00:46:03,218
What was that?

716
