No, he probably called because my phone was off.

720
00:46:17,368 --> 00:46:19,698
We do not have any reservations today, so should we close early?

721
00:46:21,298 --> 00:46:22,308
Should we?

722
00:46:23,608 --> 00:46:24,608
Hyun Joo?

723
