Darn it.

724
00:46:41,718 --> 00:46:43,258
(Na Ri)

725
00:46:44,258 --> 00:46:45,258
Darn it.

726
00:46:57,768 --> 00:46:59,278
Tae Bong.

727
00:46:59,338 --> 00:47:00,408
Darn it!

728
00:47:00,478 --> 00:47:02,208
