729
00:47:03,478 --> 00:47:06,318
Tae Bong, hello? Tae Bong?

730
00:47:09,548 --> 00:47:10,548
Tae Bong?

731
00:47:12,018 --> 00:47:13,658
Tell me about it.

732
00:47:13,718 --> 00:47:15,928
My stupid toe.

733
00:47:17,188 --> 00:47:18,928
I wanted to give you something,

734
00:47:18,998 --> 00:47:21,328
