735
00:47:21,398 --> 00:47:22,728
Is that so?

736
00:47:22,798 --> 00:47:25,298
Yes, I am in your neighbourhood right now.

737
00:47:26,538 --> 00:47:29,308
Oh, really? I am in your neighbourhood right now.

738
00:47:29,368 --> 00:47:30,368
Really?

739
00:47:30,438 --> 00:47:33,838
So you need to hurry back. Right now, this instant.

740
00:47:33,908 --> 00:47:35,078
Okay, I will be right there.

741
