745
00:47:48,788 --> 00:47:51,888
No, I need some time to myself right now.

746
00:47:51,958 --> 00:47:55,898
Do you seriously not have a single woman to ride shotgun with you?

747
00:47:55,968 --> 00:47:59,498
Hey, I do. She is petite, very shy,

748
00:47:59,568 --> 00:48:04,008
