753
00:48:24,788 --> 00:48:25,798
Right?

754
00:48:27,258 --> 00:48:28,998
Unbelievable.

755
00:48:29,068 --> 00:48:30,368
I cannot believe I brought this thing along.

756
00:48:33,098 --> 00:48:34,098
