770
00:49:41,998 --> 00:49:43,368
- Do not let go.
- I will not.

771
00:49:43,438 --> 00:49:44,968
Seriously, do not let go.

772
00:49:44,968 --> 00:49:46,008
- Good, you're doing great.
- Seriously, don't let go.

773
00:49:46,008 --> 00:49:47,078
You're doing great.

774
00:49:47,138 --> 00:49:48,138
Do not let go.

775
00:49:48,208 --> 00:49:49,648
I will not.

776
00:49:49,708 --> 00:49:51,908
Now, you are doing it, you are doing it.

777
00:49:51,978 --> 00:49:54,748
I told you not to let go, okay?

778
00:49:56,718 --> 00:49:57,918
You did it, Hong Du.

779
00:49:59,488 --> 00:50:00,958
What?

780
00:50:01,018 --> 00:50:02,018
Oh, I'm doing it.

781
00:50:39,658 --> 00:50:41,958
Man, what have you been doing all these years?

782
00:50:42,028 --> 00:50:43,868
You didn't even learn how to ride a bike from your dad.

783
00:50:50,838 --> 00:50:52,678
I mean...

784
00:50:52,738 --> 00:50:54,438
