788
00:51:13,258 --> 00:51:14,428
is this how you bring it up?

789
00:51:15,698 --> 00:51:17,528
What, in terms of beauty?

790
00:51:18,928 --> 00:51:20,638
And who's on your level for being full of yourself?

791
00:51:23,868 --> 00:51:26,378
You're making me really miss my dad, Jung Woo.

792
00:51:31,778 --> 00:51:32,778
All right, fine.

793
00:51:33,918 --> 00:51:35,718
I'll do it for you.

794
00:51:35,788 --> 00:51:36,788
Be your dad.

795
00:51:39,318 --> 00:51:41,418
The things a dad does for his daughters,

796
00:51:41,488 --> 00:51:42,528
I'll do them for you.

797
00:51:43,928 --> 00:51:46,398
I taught you how to ride a bike today.

798
00:51:46,458 --> 00:51:47,458
What else is there?

799
00:51:50,998 --> 00:51:53,168
Will you teach me how to drink, too?

800
00:51:53,238 --> 00:51:56,168
I've never tried it because I'm always working part-time.

801
00:51:56,238 --> 00:51:57,238
Sure, why not.

802
00:51:57,308 --> 00:52:00,038
Oh, what about driving? How to drive?

803
00:52:00,108 --> 00:52:01,638
I didn't use to be like this,

804
00:52:01,708 --> 00:52:04,078
but lately, I get carsick whenever I get in a car.

805
00:52:04,148 --> 00:52:05,408
I'm down for that, too.

806
00:52:05,478 --> 00:52:07,348
Oh, what else is there? What else?

807
00:52:07,418 --> 00:52:10,948
Oh, if I get a boyfriend, drinking with him and saying,

808
00:52:11,018 --> 00:52:13,988
"Don't make my daughter cry." That too?

809
00:52:16,088 --> 00:52:18,758
Come on, you should do that too.

810
00:52:18,828 --> 00:52:21,158
Why? Do you hate the idea of me seeing other guys?

811
00:52:35,478 --> 00:52:36,548
What kind of person...

812
00:52:37,608 --> 00:52:38,608
was your dad, Hong Du?

813
00:52:43,148 --> 00:52:44,948
When he got off work...

814
00:52:45,018 --> 00:52:47,288
he was the one who hugged me first.

815
00:52:47,358 --> 00:52:48,558
Chairman, are you back?

816
00:52:52,088 --> 00:52:53,398
The young lady is still awake.

817
00:53:05,608 --> 00:53:06,608
I'll see her later.

818
00:53:08,238 --> 00:53:10,148
And he was someone who constantly worried...

819
00:53:10,208 --> 00:53:12,848
that I might pass away early like my mom,

820
00:53:14,078 --> 00:53:16,318
so he never stopped worrying about me.

821
00:53:17,548 --> 00:53:20,058
Prepare for the funeral quietly.

822
00:53:21,858 --> 00:53:22,888
Just because I go...

823
00:53:25,428 --> 00:53:26,658
it won't bring her back.

824
00:53:29,058 --> 00:53:30,798
I'm so glad...

825
00:53:32,268 --> 00:53:33,268
that my dad was my dad.

826
00:53:35,968 --> 00:53:37,168
Oh, right.

827
00:53:37,238 --> 00:53:39,308
If you don't have plans later tonight, come over to my place.

828
00:53:39,378 --> 00:53:41,278
What's the occasion?

829
00:53:41,338 --> 00:53:43,478
I'll tell you if you lend me the bike.

830
00:53:43,548 --> 00:53:44,578
I need a porter.

831
00:53:48,748 --> 00:53:49,748
Here.

832
00:53:52,488 --> 00:53:53,618
Yes!

833
00:54:08,868 --> 00:54:10,508
It's a dinner date with my dad.

834
00:54:14,308 --> 00:54:15,908
She's a new kind of bike thief.

835
00:54:25,388 --> 00:54:28,918
(The Late Tae Min Seok)

836
00:54:32,228 --> 00:54:33,228
I'm here.

837
00:54:35,858 --> 00:54:38,198
I got a new car, and the only place I came to show it off...

838
00:54:39,568 --> 00:54:40,568
is here.

839
00:54:42,268 --> 00:54:44,108
I wanted to come with Hyun Joo.

840
00:54:45,138 --> 00:54:48,108
Would you have hated that?

841
00:55:02,188 --> 00:55:04,228
Let's just stay here until this melts.

842
00:55:14,538 --> 00:55:15,538
Actually...

843
00:55:18,508 --> 00:55:20,878
there was something I wanted to ask you when I came.

844
00:55:21,608 --> 00:55:22,608
(Dream Star Art Academy)

845
00:55:25,648 --> 00:55:26,648
By any chance...

846
00:55:28,418 --> 00:55:29,818
did you meet that kid up there?

847
00:55:32,348 --> 00:55:33,358
If you did,

848
00:55:37,558 --> 00:55:38,558
could you tell her something for me?

849
00:55:44,128 --> 00:55:45,568
That I miss her sometimes.

850
00:55:51,108 --> 00:55:52,108
But...

851
00:55:56,448 --> 00:55:57,578
Strangely enough,

852
00:56:00,278 --> 00:56:02,078
I can't remember her face.

853
00:56:03,088 --> 00:56:04,748
So, if you met her,

854
00:56:08,358 --> 00:56:09,728
ask her for me.

855
00:56:11,458 --> 00:56:13,098
Ask if she still hates me.

856
00:56:16,428 --> 00:56:17,428
And...

857
00:56:18,568 --> 00:56:19,868
tell her for me.

858
00:56:22,568 --> 00:56:23,908
That I am...

859
00:56:31,648 --> 00:56:32,818
so incredibly sorry.

860
00:57:13,758 --> 00:57:14,758
What the?

861
00:57:31,838 --> 00:57:33,308
Right.

862
00:57:33,308 --> 00:57:37,848
I'm only calling her because I absolutely have to.

863
00:57:43,718 --> 00:57:47,388
Wait, Cha Hong Du doesn't have a phone.

864
00:57:47,458 --> 00:57:49,558
Then how am I supposed to contact her? Darn it.

865
00:57:51,228 --> 00:57:52,428
Seriously.

866
00:57:55,498 --> 00:57:58,598
My dad is going to be so full after eating all this.

867
00:57:58,668 --> 00:58:01,098
- Here you go.
- Oh, thank you.

868
00:58:02,568 --> 00:58:06,108
(Angang Handmade Dumplings)

869
00:58:13,178 --> 00:58:14,648
Man.

870
00:58:14,718 --> 00:58:16,348
I can't believe I'm buying her something like this.

871
00:58:19,988 --> 00:58:20,988
Gosh, that scared me!

872
00:58:22,158 --> 00:58:23,158
That scared me.

873
00:58:25,758 --> 00:58:28,358
Cha Hong Du? Darn it.

874
00:58:30,828 --> 00:58:32,198
You can't just pop out of nowhere like that.

875
00:58:33,438 --> 00:58:34,438
Darn it.

876
00:58:37,208 --> 00:58:38,438
What is his problem?

877
00:58:42,678 --> 00:58:45,348
What do you think of the car? Pretty killer, right?

878
00:58:45,408 --> 00:58:47,148
Today is my first time driving it.

879
00:58:52,148 --> 00:58:55,158
Okay, okay. I'll take you for a spin.

880
00:58:55,218 --> 00:58:56,228
I don't really want to.

881
00:58:59,728 --> 00:59:01,398
I have other cars at home, too.

882
00:59:02,628 --> 00:59:04,068
You've been to my house before, right?

883
00:59:04,128 --> 00:59:05,898
Oh, did you not see the garage?

884
00:59:07,638 --> 00:59:11,438
Wow. That is so cool.

885
00:59:12,738 --> 00:59:13,738
Happy now?

886
00:59:19,178 --> 00:59:20,178
Hold on.

887
00:59:33,658 --> 00:59:36,628
It is inconvenient for me if my bodyguard doesn't have a phone.

888
00:59:36,698 --> 00:59:37,698
I already activated it.

889
00:59:43,408 --> 00:59:44,408
What are you doing?

890
00:59:44,468 --> 00:59:46,338
- Won't you save my number?
- I'll do it later.

891
00:59:46,408 --> 00:59:48,338
Why later? Do it now.

892
00:59:48,408 --> 00:59:49,608
I can do what I want.

893
00:59:49,678 --> 00:59:52,148
Why did you come all the way here just to pick a fight?

894
00:59:52,208 --> 00:59:54,048
Today is the anniversary of my dad's death,

895
00:59:54,118 --> 00:59:55,978
so I am really holding back, okay?

896
00:59:56,048 --> 00:59:57,048
Today is...

897
01:00:01,458 --> 01:00:02,718
Oh, so that's why...

898
01:00:04,958 --> 01:00:06,428
Well, what, did you think...

899
01:00:06,498 --> 01:00:09,228
I bought all this just to eat by myself?

900
01:00:12,498 --> 01:00:13,668
What about your family?

901
01:00:15,068 --> 01:00:16,468
Is there anyone to keep you company...

902
01:00:16,538 --> 01:00:18,038
Aren't you busy?

903
01:00:18,108 --> 01:00:19,838
I am incredibly busy.

904
01:00:19,908 --> 01:00:21,778
I have to hurry up and set the table for my dad.

905
01:00:52,338 --> 01:00:55,008
Oh, wow.

906
01:00:55,078 --> 01:00:56,478
Yes!

907
01:01:02,988 --> 01:01:05,988
(Stop)

908
01:01:23,768 --> 01:01:24,768
What?

909
01:01:24,838 --> 01:01:26,908
(Stop)

910
01:01:29,108 --> 01:01:32,078
(Stop)

911
01:02:19,128 --> 01:02:20,128
What's wrong with her?

912
01:02:47,088 --> 01:02:49,358
- Are you crazy? Do you want to die?
- Let go of me.

913
01:02:49,418 --> 01:02:50,458
Snap out of it, Cha Hong Du!

914
01:02:53,758 --> 01:02:55,498
It was my dad.

915
01:02:55,558 --> 01:02:58,468
I saw my dad!

916
01:02:58,528 --> 01:03:03,068
- What?
- It really was my father.

917
01:03:11,708 --> 01:03:13,518
Hong Du, here you are.

918
01:03:15,778 --> 01:03:17,318
What is it?

919
01:03:17,388 --> 01:03:18,688
You must be cold.

920
01:03:33,698 --> 01:03:34,798
Is it that good?

921
01:03:35,938 --> 01:03:37,208
Good enough to eat while crying?

922
01:03:38,708 --> 01:03:40,678
I love tteokbokki more than anything in the world.

923
01:03:42,238 --> 01:03:43,248
More than your father?

924
01:03:44,848 --> 01:03:45,848
Yes.

925
01:03:48,218 --> 01:03:49,988
Should I tell your stepmother...

926
01:03:50,048 --> 01:03:52,118
and your sisters to just leave?

927
01:03:52,188 --> 01:03:55,188
You cry like this every day when I am not around.

928
01:03:56,988 --> 01:03:59,788
If you do not like them, I will just tell them to leave.

929
01:03:59,858 --> 01:04:02,028
But then you would be lonely.

930
01:04:05,428 --> 01:04:09,268
They say adults need a partner. Otherwise, they get lonely.

931
01:04:10,538 --> 01:04:13,108
And it is also because of the smell.

932
01:04:13,178 --> 01:04:14,308
The smell?

933
01:04:14,378 --> 01:04:17,048
They say men who live alone for a long time start to smell.

934
01:04:17,108 --> 01:04:18,108
Is that so?

935
01:04:21,878 --> 01:04:23,518
Do I smell bad?

936
01:04:23,588 --> 01:04:25,388
Yes, a lot.

937
01:04:29,928 --> 01:04:31,228
Father smell.

938
01:04:38,628 --> 01:04:39,768
A good one.

939
01:04:55,748 --> 01:04:58,588
I wonder if my teacher is doing well.

940
01:05:01,088 --> 01:05:04,358
My acting was amazing back then.

941
01:05:11,068 --> 01:05:14,198
Hong Du, do you want to go on a date with your father?

942
01:05:14,268 --> 01:05:16,868
It really was my father.

943
01:05:18,268 --> 01:05:20,578
My daughter, Hong Du.

944
01:05:20,638 --> 01:05:24,248
The best thing I ever did in my life...

945
01:05:24,308 --> 01:05:26,848
was becoming your father.

946
01:05:26,918 --> 01:05:28,818
Han Jung Woo.

947
01:05:28,878 --> 01:05:29,878
No, Um Tae Bong.

948
01:05:31,018 --> 01:05:34,658
Please, please find my father.

949
01:05:36,658 --> 01:05:38,658
She, who seemed like a complete lie,

950
01:05:39,888 --> 01:05:42,628
and her world, which seemed like a lie,

951
01:05:42,698 --> 01:05:44,368
spoke to me just like that.

952
01:05:47,498 --> 01:05:49,268
Asking me to enter her world.

953
01:05:51,568 --> 01:05:53,278
Laughing and crying,

954
01:05:54,508 --> 01:05:56,748
even if it might lead to a sad ending.

955
01:06:00,578 --> 01:06:02,748
That day, when we captured each other in our eyes.

956
01:06:06,548 --> 01:06:08,258
Even if we might end up falling in love.

957
01:06:18,528 --> 01:06:21,438
(Oh! My Guard)
